WEBVTT

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:02.680
Chara-su!

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:06.360
Is everyone shugo-shugo-peppy today?

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.320
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.110
Let's enjoy it together!

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:13.630
Everyone's Hearts: Unlock!

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.120
My heart: Unlock!

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.350
Open up my heart!

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.490
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:33.920
We're going on forever!

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.190
There's nothing to fear!

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:45.300
Lately it feels like things have changed a bit...

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:51.500
And it's, well, kind of nice, you know?

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.690
Doesn't matter who you are, if you don't give up,

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:59.190
you'll fly farther than you did today.

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:02.840
Even if you cry a bunch, and get depressed,

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.660
the morning will still come! So!

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.910
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:12.800
You'll find the courage!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.050
Hold your head high, going on!

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.780
Continue on to tomorrow!

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:22.970
Your heart: Unlock!

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.850
Open up your heart!

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:30.020
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.580
We're going on forever!

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.660
There's nothing to fear!

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:49.580
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:52.610
"The Love-Love Love Investigation."

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:55.580
El, El...

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:59.060
El's an ang-El of love, love!

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:02.500
Lovely ang-El!

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.660
Which one should I draw?

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.340
You are worried about love!

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:12.020
I'm just worried about whether to
draw the orange or the flower-

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:13.700
Okay!

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:19.970
Whether your beautiful partner should
be fruit or flower, that is no problem!

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:23.990
What's important is which one
you can love the most!

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:28.980
What's the matter? You seem down.

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:32.030
I just don't feel like my usual self.

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:33.710
Could it be heartbreak?

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:37.070
That's right! Love is fleeting!

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:40.860
Love is but a dream!
A dream. A dream...

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:41.840
But!

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:44.140
You cannot let it get to you!

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:46.600
Heartbreak is the step
to your next love!

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.930
Love has no end!

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:51.740
Love is a spiral staircase that
continues to forever!

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:53.320
Spin, spin, love, love...

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:54.710
Spin, spin, love, love...

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:55.980
Spin, spin, love, love...

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:57.920
Spin, spin, love, love...

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:59.670
Everyone, I've made curry!

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:01.490
Yay, curry!

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:03.540
Ran's feeling better!

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:06.470
I forgot I was hungry.

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:09.240
So that's why you were out of it.

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:10.790
Curry rice...

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.380
Indeed, curry is love as well!

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:18.150
For example, if rice is the man,
and the roux is the woman...

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:22.680
The rice and the roux...
At first their relationship seems equal, but...!

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:26.400
As you progress eating them,
the color of the rice and the roux...

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:28.380
In other words, the color of
the man and the woman...

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:29.980
begin to combine!

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:32.690
That is the ultimate love!

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:39.230
If you don't hurry up it'll get cold.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:41.660
Love also cools easily without passion!

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:44.270
I knew it! Curry is love!

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:49.520
Curry is love!

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:51.290
Hey El, what are you doing?

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.160
Utau's callin' us!

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:54.600
'kay...

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.010
She left.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.210
Why was she here?

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:04.280
I will cheer on your love!

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:06.640
Until we meet again!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:07.940
Hey, El!

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.720
'kay...

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.930
See you next time!

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:16.140
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:18.940
The first Character we'll
introduce today is...

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:21.110
Kuta!

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:27.850
Kuta is the Guardian Character of Shota,
a boy who dreams of becoming an artist.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:32.510
He's like Miki if she were
a boy, and really cute!

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:36.610
Even his egg is like a colorful canvas!

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:50.790
The second Characters
we'll introduce are...

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:53.560
Lamila and Lulu!

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:59.520
Lamila is the Guardian Character of a Prince who
came from a far away kingdom, Shuraiya.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:02.570
He's a Kingly character,
no less so than Kiseki!

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:08.660
Then there's Lulu, who saved Lamila
when he got in trouble.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.790
She was born from Shuraiya's
servant, Pearl.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:14.000
She's very reliable.

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:18.580
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara
Encyclopedia's each week!

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.590
Look forward to it!

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:27.020
Shugo-shugo Open Heart Game!

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:32.560
We're going to be doing another personality
test that'll find out who you really are!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:36.030
Everyone at home, you play along too!

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:37.770
Here's the question:

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:43.760
It's a lovely sunny day, and you're riding
a bike in a wide open space.

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:47.180
There's one Guardian Character
by your side... Who is it?

00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:51.470
Which Guardian Character
comes to mind?

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:54.930
Eggs, have you decided?

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:56.360
Pepe-chan!

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:57.650
Rhythm!

00:05:57.650 --> 00:05:58.830
Temari!

00:05:58.830 --> 00:05:59.910
Yoru!

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:02.940
Has everyone at home decided?

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:06.670
Well then, it's time to
announce the results!

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:16.060
The character of the Guardian Character you chose
is the type of person you want as a lifelong friend!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.330
Spade, you chose Yoru.

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:24.180
You want a troublemaker and a problem child,
but someone who'll never betray his friends.

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:26.700
That's interesting, I like it.

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:30.290
Diamond, you chose Temari.

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:34.580
You want a friend who is normally kind, but
can actually be really scary when angry.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:35.640
What do you think?

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:36.760
Um...

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:38.130
That a problem?

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:39.580
Well...

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:42.340
Heart, you chose Rhythm!

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:46.490
You want to get pulled along by
a friend with a ton of energy?

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:47.600
Yes!

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:51.430
And Clover, you chose Pepe!

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:55.560
So you like cute friends that are babies
and need a lot of attention?

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.260
I love them!

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:59.420
You're the one that's spoiled!

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:01.040
Spoiled...

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:03.350
Just a big baby.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:06.290
Baby, baby, baby!

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.100
Wah!

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:15.070
Ran - Energetic and happy
Miki - Cool and artistic
Su - Warm and kind
Dia - Cool and dependable
Kiseki - Arrogant

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.370
Which did you choose,
people are home?

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:17.070
If you chose one that's not on the list,
just think of their personality, okay?

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:21.250
Kusukusu - Always giggling
Daichi - Forward facing challenger
Musashi - Good at studying
Il - A prankster
El - Very serious

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:20.200
That's the perfect type for you!

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:24.520
Okay, was it right?

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:28.020
Stay tuned for the next Open Heart Game!

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:29.430
Wah!

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:37.890
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.490
"Those Small Bits of Happiness."

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:47.450
The rain isn't stopping...

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:50.850
And I was so looking forward
to playing with everyone...

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.570
It's too bad.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:57.020
At times like these, we should search
for those small bits of happiness.

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:58.970
Small bits of happiness?

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:03.950
Just tiny bits of happiness that
happen in our everyday lives.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:05.140
For example...

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:10.170
For example, when I'm cooking
and I crack open an egg...

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:14.050
Seeing two yolks makes me
happy for some reason.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.860
Oh, I feel you there!

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:18.970
Hey, what about this?

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:21.590
When I'm watching television...

00:08:21.590 --> 00:08:27.880
If I change the channel during a commercial and the exact
same commercial is playing on the other station!

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:29.360
Now on sale! Quack!

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.790
Now on sale! Quack!

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:32.440
Now on sale! Quack!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:37.160
I'm not sure I'd call it happiness,
but it makes me a little glad.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:40.600
That's a wonderful little
bit of happiness.

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:44.250
I have one!

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.800
When I'm going for a walk...

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:51.460
If I cross a road, and I decide to
focus on my right foot...

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:59.430
When I finish crossing, if it's exactly my right
foot that's on the line, it makes me happy!

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:01.700
Oh, I feel you there!

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:04.450
Do you have something like that, Dia?

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:06.760
Me?

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.630
Oh, it's nothing...

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:12.430
Now I'm curious.

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:14.150
Out with it! Spill the beans, Dia!

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.340
For me...

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:20.580
If I glance at a clock and the numbers are all
the same, that makes me a little happy...

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:23.940
Can't compete with that!

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:29.240
Well then, everyone. Let's all search for those small
bits of happiness that even Dia couldn't find!

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:30.210
Yeah!

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:32.750
Small bits of happiness, where are you?

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.750
Come on out!

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:37.700
It's hard to find them when
you're searching for them.

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:42.810
Everyone, look!

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:48.570
It looks like we found a
small bit of happiness.

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:49.500
No.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:50.500
This is...

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:52.950
...not a small bit of happiness.

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:54.790
It's a great big one!

00:09:56.130 --> 00:10:00.770
See you!

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:05.200
Coming up next is Shugo
Chara Dokki Doki!

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.660
Today's episode is titled
"Stop Fighting!"

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.230
A fight? Between who?

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:12.510
Find out in just a bit!

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:27.140
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:31.970
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:41.820
Since I met you, I've been in a tizzy every day.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:47.350
Laughing, getting angry, going crazy... It's been tough!

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:52.650
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:57.500
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:10:57.500 --> 00:11:05.480
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:11.290
I have something to say.

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:17.230
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:23.580
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:28.090
Thank you, for everything!

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:35.660
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.800
So, when will it be?

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:51.190
Um, either in sixth grade or the
first year of middle school.

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:54.280
I can't get a boyfriend until then?

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:57.660
Oh, Hikaru!

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:01.150
Hikaru, wanna try?

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.330
Palm reading! You know,
fortune telling!

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:04.730
Show me your palm.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:06.990
There's no scientific basis to it.

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:13.960
If you could predict the future like that,
human effort would all be for naught.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:19.300
Fortune telling is just a crutch used by those
uncertain of their futures, an illusion.

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:24.430
Kimi-chan!

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:27.260
Don't pay attention to
what Hikaru says!

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.680
Why must you cry?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:33.130
Hikaru! Put yourself in
her shoes for once!

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:36.770
You don't understand
Kimi-chan's feelings!

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:39.190
Can you understand other
people's feelings?

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.410
Rikka?

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.930
Rikka, what did you do?

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:56.690
But, Hikaru...

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:59.000
Nothing good will come from fighting!

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.800
Now apologize, you two.

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:04.170
I got slapped!
I'm the victim!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.550
But Hikaru was at fault!

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:09.690
Stop being so stubborn, you two!

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:10.580
Hey...

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.390
And you hit Hikaru-kun, Rikka!

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:14.380
You don't know anything, Amu-senpai!

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:16.630
Let's go, Kimi-chan!

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:19.270
Rikka...

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:22.580
15 - Stop Fighting!

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:25.490
Hikaru-kun, yeah...

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:27.770
Where did he go?

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:30.370
He said he was busy and
would come later.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:32.510
Why did she hit him?

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:35.790
Everyone was like that when
we were little, right?

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:38.080
We fought over little things.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:42.510
Against boys it was good just to bring
'em down with a big first shot-dechu!

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:47.380
I bet that Rikka-chan was angry in defense
of her friend instead of herself.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:51.630
But Hikaru-kun isn't the type of
person who would bully someone.

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:54.610
It's probably a small misunderstanding.

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:57.380
I bet they'd understand each other
if they talk it over a bit.

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:06.370
Did I say something weird?

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:08.600
You really <i>are</i> a sixth grader!

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:11.160
That was like, really big
sister of you right then!

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:12.870
Y-You think?

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:16.040
But yeah, graduation is just up ahead.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:18.570
After we graduate...

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:25.030
Don't worry!

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:26.820
Leave everything to Yaya!

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:30.610
Talking with food in your
mouth is bad manners!

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:33.480
Oh yeah!

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:35.550
I felt it just before...

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:36.170
Right!

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:37.560
I felt it!

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:38.980
What are you talking about?

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:43.270
We felt a Guardian Egg near
Rikka-chan earlier.

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.170
We think she might have given
birth to a Guardian Egg!

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:49.750
Really?

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:50.340
Then...

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:52.910
...I will have another faithful servant!

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:55.590
But Rikka-chan and Hikaru-kun are...

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:57.980
...really late.

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.410
Yeah.

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:05.380
Where did Rikka and the others go?

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:18.180
You surprised me!

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:21.530
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:23.700
Are you alone, too?

00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:29.820
Sit down there.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.820
Oh, I see.

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:38.200
Amu-senpai, you see...

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:43.920
She's really cool and awesome, but
she never listens to me at all.

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:45.660
I'm only ever apologizing to her.

00:15:45.660 --> 00:15:47.600
Isn't that strange?

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:51.670
You'd get angry if someone was
mean to your friends, right?

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:56.930
Hey, wait!

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:02.590
I see.

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:04.020
So, that's why she hit you.

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:06.650
Well, I suppose it's only natural.

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:08.960
But I'm the victim!

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:11.280
You used to collect pretty
stones, right?

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:14.530
If someone told you that was pointless,
how would you feel.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:19.420
They had value.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:20.990
But they are just stones.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:22.960
See?

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:31.810
You feel unsettled, right in there.

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:34.380
Try touching it?

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:37.140
Do you understand?

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:42.530
If you imagine that, then you can
think of how other people feel.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.690
I see...

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:55.610
I can feel something!

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:57.290
It's an X Egg!

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:57.990
Rima!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:16:58.780
Right!

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.190
Ran!

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:07.370
Kusukusu!

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.340
My heart:

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:11.980
My heart:

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:13.590
Unlock!

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:30.850
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:36.690
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:42.210
Heart Speeders!

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:44.170
Wait!

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:48.420
Tight Rope Dancer!

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:54.860
Wait!

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:05.100
I'm not gonna tell Amu-senpai
what that X Egg is sayin'.

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:08.770
Juggling Party!

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:19.700
Amu!

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.780
What are you doing, Amu?

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:25.650
I was just thinking...

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:34.170
When I first started fighting X Eggs, I considered
the feelings of the people they came from.

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:40.100
But when Easter got involved, and started
making a lot of X Eggs at once...

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:48.630
We forgot about the pain of each
one individually, didn't we?

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:54.150
Amu...

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:58.520
Rikka made me remember that.

00:18:59.980 --> 00:19:02.210
Amu-senpai!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:04.470
Senpai!

00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:05.570
Rikka!

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:10.490
That X Egg feels like it can't
make any friends!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.530
I see.

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:18.960
You want to hold hands
with a friend, right?

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.280
Don't worry.

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:26.090
If you hold out that hand, someone
will be sure to grasp it!

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:31.940
What's important is your feelings!

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:39.190
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:42.870
Open Heart!

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:03.410
I'm sorry.

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:06.140
If you're going to apologize,
then don't do it to Amu.

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:18.080
I'm sorry for hitting you.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.570
Sorry.

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:28.780
If my words hurt you and your friend,

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:31.860
then I feel like I should apologize.

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:37.000
Make sure to apologize
to Kimi-chan later.

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.000
Yeah.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.810
Okay, here.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:43.510
Shake and make-up.

00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:08.050
Amu-senpai is not just cool,
she's also really kind.

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:13.290
Maybe I want to become a
person like Amu-senpai.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:14.450
Impossible!

00:21:15.070 --> 00:21:16.990
It's not impossible, geeze!

00:21:26.170 --> 00:21:27.930
Is this...

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:29.550
Could it be...

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:35.020
A Guardian Egg?

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:37.430
Yippee!

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:41.340
I gave birth to a Guardian Egg!

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:46.760
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:50.830
Choose one of these four eggs!

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:55.180
Which egg will be the lucky one?

00:21:58.740 --> 00:22:00.920
Guardian Egg Studying Fortune!

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:03.250
First, for those of you who
chose Miki's egg...

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:04.570
Four Shugoluck stars!

00:22:04.570 --> 00:22:05.940
Super lucky!

00:22:05.940 --> 00:22:09.460
You're all raring to go!  Challenge
the subjects you are weak at!

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:11.720
It's a chance to improve those grades!

00:22:12.140 --> 00:22:14.140
Su's egg is three shugoluck stars!

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:16.910
Use another kid who's good
at studying as a model!

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:16.910
You might find new studying techniques!

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:18.570
Ran's egg is two shugoluck stars.

00:22:18.570 --> 00:22:20.000
Your concentration might waver...

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:21.940
Take things at your own pace!

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:24.780
Finally, for those of you
who chose Dia's egg...

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:27.970
You get, um... one shugoluck star.

00:22:27.970 --> 00:22:30.470
You're motivated but you don't
seem to be getting anywhere.

00:22:30.470 --> 00:22:34.450
Drink some tea and relax.

00:22:30.470 --> 00:22:34.450
Lucky item: Tea

00:22:38.310 --> 00:22:40.420
Today sure was fun!

00:22:40.990 --> 00:22:43.520
See you next time on
Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:46.830
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:47.450 --> 00:22:49.280
Bye-bye!

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:20.040
Now's the time to make your move.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:24.690
Nothing will start if you start worrying.

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:27.110
A song to your lips!

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:30.830
Yeah! What're you waiting for?

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:33.610
Bang on this door to the world.

00:23:33.610 --> 00:23:37.490
On whose terms?  That's right, ours!

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:43.020
Just trying to grasp success before you,

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:48.590
you're sure to become lost in the labyrinth.

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:55.670
Embrace the melody in your heart!

00:23:55.670 --> 00:24:00.830
Try singing it, try shouting it!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:11.640
Each time you get closer to who you
want to be, they'll be given birth:

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:14.260
Our Songs!
